\section{Experimental Framework and Results}
The updated computational batch utilizes project orchestration scripts for end to end translation and exhaustive electrical verification. The evaluated corpus features 17 process design kit families and 322 raw source files. The targeted verifications performed on the translated ngspice outputs encompass 52 valid files from 15 process design kit families. It is critical to enforce sequential execution for strict reproducibility: systematic translation initiates within a clean workspace, followed immediately by rigorous verification involving Monte Carlo mechanisms, concluding with analytical plot aggregation.

Table~\ref{tab:summary} lists the aggregate macroscopic outcomes. The verification segment completely fulfills the established standard, recording 587 identical successful tests across the 15 targeted process design kit domains. This perfect operational compliance provides profound validation that the framework achieves its fundamental overarching objective of demonstrating a greater than 95 percent effective pass rate standard.

